sequenceDiagram
    actor U as You
    participant FE as Dashboard (Web App)
    participant Auth as Auth.js
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database (Postgres)

    U->>FE: First login (new account)
    FE->>Auth: Authenticate (Google, Microsoft, or Apple)

    alt Auth succeeds
        Auth->>DB: Save user + account record
        Auth->>DB: Set lastLoginAt
        Auth->>FE: Session cookie set
    else Auth fails or denied
        Auth-->>FE: Auth error
        FE->>U: Show error, offer retry
    end

    FE->>API: Check onboarding status
    API-->>FE: Not onboarded

    FE->>U: "What matters most to you?"
    Note over FE,U: Curated set of categories (e.g. Work, Social, Gaming, Fitness, Chores) — not unlimited custom options
    U->>FE: Select a few categories

    FE->>U: "What's your timezone and when does your week start?"
    U->>FE: Set timezone + week-start day

    FE->>API: Submit onboarding selections
    API->>DB: Save categories + timezone + week-start prefs
    API->>DB: Mark onboarding complete

    API-->>FE: Onboarding complete
    FE->>U: Proceed to home screen
